# Check out text files with LF on every platform.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true gives Windows working copies CRLF endings,
# while Prettier defaults to endOfLine: "lf" — so `npm run format:check` fails
# locally on files that are perfectly fine in the repo and on CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never normalize binaries.
*.avif binary
*.jpg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.woff2 binary
